# Acceptance run 1 of our own image and service (accept-run.sh). About 13.5 hours.
# 1: the image as decided (KV cache fixed, limit not yet set): checks, agent cells through the forwarder and straight to the engine, passkey test
a1-image-default       image VIA=both SET=short CTX=385000 COUNTS=1,5,8
# 2: the same with the 400k limit set in the engine: checks incl. the limit, agent cells, 8 new contexts at once, passkey test
a2-image-maxlen400k    image MAXLEN=400000 SET=short CTX=385000 COUNTS=1,5,8 BURST=1
# 3: the 12-hour soak at 8 x 400k through the forwarder; with the 400k limit if item 2 passed
a3-image-soak          image SET=short CTX=385000 COUNTS=8 STRESS_MIN=720 STRESS_CTX=360000 IF_OK=a2-image-maxlen400k:MAXLEN=400000
